fixture wall_coyote_expires
doc docs/adr/0010 wall coyote time, its control: 7 frames after pushing away, the press is the air jump
room test/shaft
spawn 760 300
frames 40
input
  0..9 R
  10..16 L
  17..24 L jump
  25..39 L
end
expect
  at 9 state=wall
  at 17 event.wall_jump=0 event.air_jump=1
end
